<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="cat-7b24-e6f1-83a9-4c50" name="Legiones Astartes — Generic Library" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="true" gameSystemId="sys-6f3a-91d2-b47c-5e08" gameSystemRevision="15" type="catalogue">
  <comment>Revision 69: Primarch Chosen troop-role fix. Generic Legion Veteran and Terminator Troops entries now enable for Primarch Chosen as well as Pride of the Legion. Legion-specific Terminator units that normally occupy Elites dynamically move to Troops under either Rite.</comment>
  <readme>Core Legiones Astartes catalogue for Prohammer 30k. Revision 32 includes the generic Legion army list and Consuls, Dark Angels package, Legiones Astartes Lords of War, and Legiones Astartes Aeronautica Imperialis aircraft. Experimental Wargear and Units remains excluded.</readme>
