ea5682" name="Krak Grenades — whole pack" type="upgrade" hidden="false" /><selectionEntry id="r41-universal-gear-2eb78c848cb0c8" name="Frag Grenades — whole squad" type="upgrade" hidden="false" /><selectionEntry id="r41-universal-gear-2b6bc7a66ab9d7" name="Krak Grenades — whole squad" type="upgrade" hidden="false" /><selectionEntry id="r41-universal-gear-0df26c3cf1dfbe" name="Melta Bombs — whole squad" type="upgrade" hidden="false" /><selectionEntry id="r41-universal-gear-a9fefd4170cdfc" name="Beyond Judgement — Fear (Trophies already equipped)" type="upgrade" hidden="false"><rules>
            <rule id="r41-universal-gear-a9fefd4170cdfc-fbd51de0f620" name="Beyond Judgement" hidden="false">
              <description>This squad already carries Trophies of Judgement. Under Horror Cult it may still purchase Beyond Judgement for +25 points per unit; doing so grants Fear and treats the squad as equipped with Trophies of Judgement in the manner specified by the Rite. Measure the 8-inch Leadership penalty from any model. Trophies penalties remain non-cumulative.</description>
