      </categoryLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Legion Centurion" id="hq-centurion-prof" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="model-sv" value="2+" id="r29-cent-sv-forge">
              <conditions>
                <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hq-consul-forge" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
            <modifier type="set" field="model-sv" value="2+/4+" id="r29-cent-sv-null">
              <conditions>
                <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hq-consul-null" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Standard Wargear" id="hq-centurion-std" hidden="false">
          <description>Power Armour, Bolt Pistol, Chainsword and Frag Grenades.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Legiones Astartes" id="hq-centurion-la" hidden="false">
          <description>The model has the Legiones Astartes special rule, also has And They Shall Know No Fear as presented in ProHammer Classic, and is not Fearless unless another rule says otherwise.

And They Shall Know No Fear: Automatically passes Regroup tests at the start of the turn and may be used normally for the rest of the turn. If caught by a pursuit, the unit automatically regroups and is re-engaged in close combat, and does not suffer extra wounds from being caught in a pursuit. Immune to Fear.
Fear: Enemy units in base contact must pass a Leadership test before resolving their close combat attacks. If the test fails, those units attack with WS1 in the melee engagement.
Fearless: Automatically passes all Morale and Pinning tests. May not Take Cover! or choose to voluntarily fail a break test.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Frag Grenades" id="hq-centurion-frag" hidden="false">
          <description>Uses the normal ProHammer Frag Grenade and Assault Grenade rules. Against vehicles, Frag Grenades have Strength 4 + D6 Armour Penetration.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Legion Consuls" id="hq-centurion-consulrule" hidden="false">
          <description>A Legion Centurion may be upgraded to no more than one Consul type. A Consul retains the Centurion profile, wargear, special rules and Armoury access unless stated otherwise. Wargear granted by a Consul is included in its upgrade cost and does not count toward the Armoury allowance. Consul restrictions override normal Centurion options.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Space Marine Armoury" id="hq-centurion-armoury-rule" hidden="false">
          <description>The Centurion may select up to 100 points of weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury. Armour, Mobility, Weapon Replacements and Additional Wargear all count toward the same 100-point limit. All normal Armoury restrictions apply. Consul-granted wargear is included in the Consul cost and does not count against this allowance.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r18-ts-centurion-psyker-rule" name="Sorcerers of Prospero — Independent Character" hidden="true"><description>In a Thousand Sons Detachment, a Legion Centurion and its Consul variants are Psykers (Mastery Level 1) unless another rule grants a higher Mastery Level. Its psychic powers are selected from the single Psychic Discipline associated with its chosen Prosperine Cult: Pavoni — Biomancy; Raptora — Telekinesis; Corvidae — Divination; Athanaeans — Telepathy; Pyrae — Pyromancy. A Librarian Consul follows the normal Librarian upgrade rules; an Epistolary is Mastery Level 2.</description></rule></rules>
      <entryLinks>
        <entryLink import="true" name="Bolt Pistol" id="hq-centurion-bp" type="selectionEntry" targetId="gear-bolt-pistol" hidden="false" defaultAmount="1">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="hq-centurion-bp-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" automatic="true" />
            <constraint id="hq-centurion-bp-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </constraints>
        </entryLink>
        <entryLink import="true" name="Chainsword" id="hq-centurion-cs" type="selectionEntry" targetId="gear-chainsword" hidden="false" defaultAmount="1">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="hq-centurion-cs-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" automatic="true" />
            <constraint id="hq-centurion-cs-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </constraints>
        </entryLink>
      </entryLinks>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Legion Consul Upgrade" id="hq-centurion-consuls" hidden="false">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="hq-centurion-consuls-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Legion Chaplain Consul" id="hq-consul-chaplain" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="hq-consul-chaplain-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="35" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Legion Chaplain Consul" id="hq-consul-chaplain-rule" hidden="false">
                  <description>This Centurion is upgraded to Legion Chaplain Consul. Granted wargear and special rules are shown separately below.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Honour of the Legion" id="r29-chap-honour" hidden="false">
                  <description>The Chaplain and any unit he has joined have the Fearless special rule.

Fearless: Automatically passes all Morale and Pinning tests. May not Take Cover! or choose to voluntarily fail a break test.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Liturgies of Battle" id="r29-chap-liturgies" hidden="false">
                  <description>In a player turn in which the Chaplain and a unit he has joined successfully charge, the Chaplain and all models in that unit may re-roll failed To Hit rolls in close combat for that Assault phase.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <entryLinks>
                <entryLink import="true" name="Crozius Arcanum" id="r29-chap-crozius" type="selectionEntry" targetId="r29-gear-crozius" hidden="false" defaultAmount="1">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="r29-chap-crozius-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" automatic="true" />
                    <constraint id="r29-chap-crozius-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
                  </constraints>
                </entryLink>
                <entryLink import="true" name="Rosarius" id="r29-chap-rosarius" type="selectionEntry" targetId="r29-gear-rosarius" hidden="false" defaultAmount="1">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="r29-chap-rosarius-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" automatic="true" />
                    <constraint id="r29-chap-rosarius-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
                  </constraints>
                </entryLink>
              </entryLinks>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-vi" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
                <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
                  <conditionGroups>
                    <conditionGroup type="and">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-vi" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
                      </conditions>
                    </conditionGroup>
                  </conditionGroups>
                </modifier>
              <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden" id="mod-r62-shat-470554c9e37f">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="r62-shat-assign-a5a2be9b53fe" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
                  <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="r62-shattered-theme" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></conditions>
                </modifier>
                <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden" id="mod-r62-shat-e25424e2ba0b">
                  <conditionGroups>
                    <conditionGroup type="and">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="r62-shat-assign-a5a2be9b53fe" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
                      <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="r62-shattered-theme" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></conditions>
                    </conditionGroup>
                  </conditionGroups>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink id="r80-ih-consul-cat-0" name="Head of the Gorgon — non-Forge-Lord Consul" hidden="false" targetId="r80-ih-head-nonforge-consul" primary="false" />
                <categoryLink id="r81-ih-consul-cat-0" name="Head of the Gorgon — non-Forge Consul" hidden="true" targetId="r81-ih-nonforge-consul" primary="false" />
              <categoryLink id="hq-consul-chaplain-r37-darkap" name="Word Bearers — Dark Shepherd" targetId="r37-wb-dark-apostle-req" hidden="false" /><categoryLink id="hq-consul-chaplain-r40-chap" name="Awakening Fire — Chaplain" targetId="r40-sal-awakening-chaplain" hidden="false" /></categoryLinks>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Legion Librarian Consul" id="hq-consul-librarian" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="hq-consul-librarian-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Legion Librarian Consul" id="hq-consul-librarian-rule" hidden="false">
                  <description>This Centurion is upgraded to Legion Librarian Consul. Granted wargear and special rules are shown separately below.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Psyker (Mastery Level 1)" id="r29-lib-psyker" hidden="false">
                  <description>The Librarian is a Psyker with Mastery Level 1 and follows the ProHammer Classic psychic rules.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Legion Support Officer" id="r29-lib-support" hidden="false">
                  <description>May not fulfil the compulsory HQ selection unless another rule specifically permits it.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Psychic Powers" id="r29-lib-powers" hidden="false">
                  <description>Select powers from Biomancy, Divination, Pyromancy, Telekinesis or Telepathy. Daemonology is not available. ProHammer allows powers to be chosen rather than randomly generated.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Epistolary — Mastery Level 2" id="hq-consul-librarian-epistolary" hidden="false" import="true">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="hq-consul-librarian-epistolary-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" />
                  </costs>
                  <selectionEntryGroups>
                    <selectionEntryGroup id="r61-librarian-power2" name="Additional Psychic Power — select 1" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="r61-librarian-power2-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
                        <constraint id="r61-librarian-power2-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
                      </constraints>
                      <selectionEntries>
                        <selectionEntry id="r61-librarian-power2-biomancy-smite" name="Biomancy — Smite" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
                          <constraints>
                            <constraint id="r61-librarian-power2-biomancy-smite-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
                          </constraints>
                          <costs>
                            <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" />
                          </costs>
                          <profiles>
                            <profile id="r61-librarian-power2-biomancy-smite-profile" name="Smite" hidden="false" typeId="prof-ranged" typeName="Ranged Weapon">
                              <characteristics>
                                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="ranged-range">18"</characteristic>
                                <characteristic name="S" typeId="ranged-s">4</characteristic>
                                <characteristic name="AP" typeId="ranged-ap">2</characteristic>
                                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="ranged-type">Assault 4, Witchfire</characteristic>
                              </characteristics>
                            </profile>
                          </profiles>
                          <rules>
                            <rule id="r61-librarian-power2-biomancy-smite-rule" name="Smite" hidden="false">
