                      </categoryLinks>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Endurance" id="r29-lib-power-5" hidden="false" import="true">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="r29-lib-power-5-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
                      </constraints>
                      <rules>
                        <rule name="Endurance" id="r29-lib-power-5-rule" hidden="false">
                          <description>Blessing — friendly unit within 24”. The unit gains Eternal Warrior, Feel No Pain (5+) and Relentless.

Relentless: Model may move and fire Heavy, Ordnance, Salvo or Rapid Fire weapons as if it remained stationary. It may still charge even after firing such weapons.
Eternal Warrior: Immune to Instant Death / Massive Wounds. The model suffers 1 Wound instead of D3 Wounds.</description>
                        </rule>
                      </rules>
                      <modifiers>
                        <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
                          <conditions>
                            <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="r29-lib-discipline-0" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                          </conditions>
                        </modifier>
