Fleet: Unit may still charge into melee combat even if it advanced this turn.</description>
                                </rule>
                              </rules>
                            </selectionEntry>
                            <selectionEntry id="r61-ws-stormseer-power2-biomancy-endurance" name="Biomancy — Endurance" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
