        <rule id="r46-al-reward-2-donor-r52-ec-kako-third-relentless" name="3rd Company Elite" hidden="false">
          <description>If this Detachment uses the 3rd Company Elite Rite of War, this Kakophoni Squad gains Relentless.

Relentless: Model may move and fire Heavy, Ordnance, Salvo or Rapid Fire weapons as if it remained stationary. It may still charge even after firing such weapons.</description>
