      <rules>
        <rule id="r46-al-reward-35-donor-r8-um-ful-dt-transport-rule" name="Dedicated Transport" hidden="false"><description>This squad may select the listed Dedicated Transport where Transport Capacity permits.</description></rule><rule id="r46-al-reward-35-donor-r8-r41-unit-xiii-1-fulmentarus-terminator-squad-rule-0" name="Guided Warheads" hidden="false"><description>When firing Frag missiles from their Cyclone Missile Launchers, Fulmentarus Terminators may fire at an enemy unit they cannot see if that unit is visible to a friendly model equipped with a Nuncio Vox. The Nuncio Vox bearer may not be embarked, Falling Back, Pinned or engaged in close combat. These shots must use Frag missiles, count as Barrage and follow normal ProHammer Barrage rules. Krak missiles may not use Guided Warheads.</description></rule><rule id="r46-al-reward-35-donor-r8-r41-unit-xiii-1-fulmentarus-terminator-squad-rule-1" name="Wargear" hidden="false"><description>Cataphractii Terminator Armour; Storm bolter; Power fist; Cyclone Missile Launcher.</description></rule></rules>
