ana — Ashen Blow" hidden="false" targetId="r36-exact-cult-arcana-ashen-blow-887d335" type="rule" /><infoLink id="r46-al-reward-45-donor-r45-cult-r41-unit-xv-5-numerologist-cabal-r59-4-r59-info-1" name="Cult Mastery — Ashen Blow" hidden="false" targetId="r36-exact-cult-mastery-ashen-blow-a469105" type="rule" /></infoLinks></selectionEntry></selectionEntries>
